{
  "bookId": "hero-211014",
  "id": "bond-38804",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "38804001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "……王子解除诅咒变回人类，从此和公主幸福地生活在一起。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "故事结束，下次见。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "菲伊在读童话吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "嗯？|101|，你来得很巧，我的工作刚结束。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "38804006",
              "text": "欸，刚刚不是在休息？！"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "38804006",
              "text": "原来刚才不是休息时间……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "38804005",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "是劳动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "考虑到无报酬这点，算是「志愿服务」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "无报酬？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "嗯，是那株玫瑰的愿望。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "她想成为童话里的玫瑰？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "准确来说，她想成为在结局画面中被公主拿着的那枝玫瑰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好，好具体的心愿……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那我们接下来要去找可以扮演公主的手办吗？感觉有很多人选……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "不，要去图书馆借书。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "38804017",
              "text": "去图书馆？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "38804017",
              "text": "要借什么书？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "38804016",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "去借现代社会体制相关的书目。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菲伊",
          "text": "这样就可以委婉地向玫瑰说明现在没有公主了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "委婉……果然还是去找手办扮演公主吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38804020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "为了保护玫瑰的心愿，请菲伊部长再次考虑！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
